	<<tearful>> you manage to push the <<person>> off the bunk. <<He>> falls against the frame opposite, catches <<his>> balance and hurries away between the rows before you can follow.
<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	The <<person>> gets up and leaves without speaking to you. <<tearful>> you sit on the edge of the bunk and pull your clothes back into place before standing.
